<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>投资工具箱</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f0f4f8;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --primary: #0f766e;
            --primary-dark: #115e59;
            --blue: #2563eb;
            --blue-dark: #1d4ed8;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --text-secondary: #64748b;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            --shadow-hover: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            --radius: 18px;
            --transition: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #eef7f4 0%, #e8f0ee 25%, #f0f4f8 50%, #eef4fa 75%, #f5f3f0 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
            color: var(--text);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 750px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 28px;
        }

        /* 头部 */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 8px 0;
        }
        .hero .logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e 0%, #14b8a6 50%, #2563eb 100%);
            border-radius: 18px;
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.25);
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-6px);
            }
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            color: #1e293b;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 6px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* 卡片网格 */
        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 18px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .cards-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .hero .logo {
                width: 52px;
                height: 52px;
                font-size: 26px;
                border-radius: 14px;
            }
        }

        /* 单个卡片 */
        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 26px 22px 22px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all var(--transition);
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
        }
        .card.card-teal::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f766e, #14b8a6);
        }
        .card.card-blue::before {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #60a5fa);
        }
        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        }
        .card:active {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .card .card-icon {
            font-size: 36px;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .card .card-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .card .card-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .card .card-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .card .card-tags span {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }
        .card-teal .card-tags span {
            background: #ccfbf1;
            color: #0f766e;
        }
        .card-blue .card-tags span {
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: #1d4ed8;
        }
        .card .card-arrow {
            align-self: flex-end;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .card:hover .card-arrow {
            transform: translateX(4px);
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* 底部 */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 头部 -->
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="logo">📐</div>
            <h1>投资工具箱</h1>
            <p>两个实用工具，帮您看清财富增长与合伙权益</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 工具卡片 -->
        <div class="cards-grid">
            <!-- 复利计算器 -->
            <a href="calculator.html" class="card card-teal" title="打开复利计算器">
                <div class="card-icon">📈</div>
                <div class="card-title">复利计算器</div>
                <div class="card-desc">
                    模拟投资增长，可视化复利效应。支持自定义本金、利率、年限和定投金额。
                </div>
                <div class="card-tags">
                    <span>复利</span>
                    <span>定投</span>
                    <span>图表</span>
                </div>
                <span class="card-arrow">→</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 合伙投资管理 -->
            <a href="partnership.html" class="card card-blue" title="打开合伙投资管理系统">
                <div class="card-icon">🤝</div>
                <div class="card-title">合伙投资管理</div>
                <div class="card-desc">
                    管理多人合伙投资，支持中途加入与退出，按净值自动结算份额。
                </div>
                <div class="card-tags">
                    <span>合伙</span>
                    <span>净值</span>
                    <span>份额</span>
                </div>
                <span class="card-arrow">→</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 底部 -->
    </div>
</body>
</html>
